{"title":"2025 CSMC Problems/Part A Problem 4","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The integers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> are perfect squares with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/e/0/ae06b0379f968112f7ed9d738ab9e8e75fb70455.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x - y = 35$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"86\" height=\"17\" />. What are the possible values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/8/5/a859acebdd07c34704648be45c0daf108e2a29d9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x + y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"44\" height=\"16\" />?\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/c/b1c26b0a97219d848e50acef4742e05fc3b49d79.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = a^{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"54\" height=\"17\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/1/0/110c93cf16995b45653a184913276ae3054433bc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = b^{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"51\" height=\"20\" /> for some non-negative integers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> because <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> are stated to be perfect squares. This gives:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/a/fca9def93275237bede2e66122f2399ddb576789.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a - b)(a + b) = 35$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"152\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p>From this, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/f/5df6a591474ffd81edd37d8d9f52f6f476caa531.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a + b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"41\" height=\"16\" /> must be positive since they are non-negative, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/0/d/70d6f5ca6abcd13d9411a9c406420f617c1e8d50.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a - b$\" width=\"40\" height=\"12\" /> is also positive and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/f/5df6a591474ffd81edd37d8d9f52f6f476caa531.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a + b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"41\" height=\"16\" /> would have to be at least <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/0/d/70d6f5ca6abcd13d9411a9c406420f617c1e8d50.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a - b$\" width=\"40\" height=\"12\" />. This means that the possible pairs would be:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/d/c/fdcb1f6dd363e9dbe4f8c4f57ac5c1c3165c9175.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a + b = 35$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"84\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/6/33670a9e3dd2c4c741610ff9153751042fbb122c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a - b = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"72\" height=\"13\" />\n</p><p>or\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/f/1/0f1b8f51063fdd4b7c7f274406344922dffcd38b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a + b = 7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"75\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/d/6/cd6d950c9e98332536f1a7f78ae7865cce0da22d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a - b = 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"75\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p>If the first two are true, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/b/b/2bb0f5b5ecb462ddb1d159522f04c6a3b1d4d88d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a + b + a - b = 35 + 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"177\" height=\"16\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/b/9/2b93dd0177914f60de1cc2b2bb50bdea203c25cf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2a = 36$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"63\" height=\"14\" />, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/f/7/df7b66f4b4d7050101aa1694f4e0176ec0ee5b63.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = 18$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"51\" height=\"13\" />. This would mean <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/a/f/1af14212bd8da071120ab50f49274f3c0fbcea97.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$18 + b = 35$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"92\" height=\"16\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/d/b/1db86dc95dd16c8b03aca06aae127f2a97bbdb26.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = 17$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"52\" height=\"14\" />. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/8/5/a859acebdd07c34704648be45c0daf108e2a29d9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x + y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"44\" height=\"16\" /> would then be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/d/3/9d3b82bd5e86a868797cd8922542e8173281a4ce.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$18^{2} + 17^{2} = 324 + 289 = \\boxed{613}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"239\" height=\"25\" />.\n</p><p>If the last two are true, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/6/2/e62ee57246d607a38ac46592962cdc52fd522e3e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a + b + a - b = 7 + 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"168\" height=\"16\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cd3921c42f9ab10433602a0a4bbbb37a72665e0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2a = 12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"63\" height=\"14\" />, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/a/c/eac964e50ab7e4904f600a0a12e157a994617fe4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = 6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"45\" height=\"14\" />. This would mean <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/1/011498d2e4772e75c035d8e6975fe6172aa7f28d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6 + b = 7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"74\" height=\"16\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/5/1/851b03ce92c3ad8da97daf2785cf4e103c7a8d66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"40\" height=\"13\" />. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/8/5/a859acebdd07c34704648be45c0daf108e2a29d9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x + y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"44\" height=\"16\" /> would then be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/5/fc5e6903868d74fbc2d65120126bf86a492d66d5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6^{2} + 1^{2} = 36 + 1 = \\boxed{37}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"185\" height=\"25\" />.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CSMC\" title=\"2025 CSMC\">2025 CSMC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CSMC_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2025 CSMC Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CSMC_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2025 CSMC Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_3\" title=\"2025 CSMC Problems/Part A Problem 3\">Part A Problem 3</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2025 CSMC Problems/Part A Problem 5 (page does not exist)\">Part A Problem 5</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_1\" title=\"2025 CSMC Problems/Part A Problem 1\">Part A 1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_2\" title=\"2025 CSMC Problems/Part A Problem 2\">Part A 2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_3\" title=\"2025 CSMC Problems/Part A Problem 3\">Part A 3</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Part A 4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2025 CSMC Problems/Part A Problem 5 (page does not exist)\">Part A 5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2025 CSMC Problems/Part A Problem 6 (page does not exist)\">Part A 6</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CSMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_1\" title=\"2025 CSMC Problems/Part B Problem 1\">Part B 1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CSMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2025 CSMC Problems/Part B Problem 2 (page does not exist)\">Part B 2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CSMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2025 CSMC Problems/Part B Problem 3 (page does not exist)\">Part B 3</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=CEMC_Senior_Competition\" title=\"CEMC Senior Competition\">CEMC Senior Competition</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018070415\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.027 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.050 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 167/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1283/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 134/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 5856/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    7.742      1 Template:CEMC_CIMC/CSMC_box\n100.00%    7.742      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:37470:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018070415 and revision id 289507. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}